 {"recommendationid": "230559849", "author": {"steamid": "76561198824521027", "personaname": "Captain tikleBLLZ", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198824521027/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 110, "playtime_forever": 355, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 273, "last_played": 1784255026, "avatar": "21d051db691ef4a1f1e41942ecf0efb0028e303a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Tuff\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1784147796, "timestamp_updated": 1784147796, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230557699", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038867300", "personaname": "MasterZoen", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MasterZoentrobe/", "num_games_owned": 2284, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 790, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 635, "last_played": 1784171291, "avatar": "7a98d429d9fb61bb6065773f2005fce7257463a8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still works great running on Windows 11, Ryzen 7 5800X3D, RTX 3090, 64GB of DDR4 3200 CL 16.\n\nYou'll need to either use MSCONFIG to change the number of CPU Cores available to 8 total or, a far better option is to download and install the Windows ADK Compatibility Administrator. Only tick the first box of the installer, untick the rest. \n\nOnce installed, open the 32-bit version of the Compatibility Administrator, then click on the \"new database\" under the Custom Databse tab and click menu for \"Database > Create New > Application Fix\".\n\nNext, you need to select the game application file either through \"Browse\" or by typing the full address in. For most people, that will be this: \n\"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Warhammer 40,000 Space Marine\\SpaceMarine.exe\"\n\nClick next, click next to skip Compatibility Mode stuff, and on the Compatibility Fixes menu scroll down to the \"P\" section. If you are running a Ryzen CPU, you need to tick \"ProcessorCountLie\". For an Intel CPU with Efficiency Cores, you need to tick \"ProcessorCountLieForHybridCPU\". With the correct one selected, click \"Parameters\" and put \"8\" in the command line, and click \"Okay\". You can go ahead and click \"Test Run\" to make sure it works and change to the other option if you got it wrong, then click \"Next\", and click \"Finish.\n\nNow, click \"Save\" and Name the database, then save it to disk somewhere you'll find it.", "timestamp_created": 1784145571, "timestamp_updated": 1784145571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230519990", "author": {"steamid": "76561198418422283", "personaname": "op", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198418422283/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 652, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 652, "last_played": 1784102813, "avatar": "2201b1de3a95a1ced9adc1555f8a0e725dc1841c"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is quite fun I’d personally give it a solid 7.5 out of 10. My advice would be to pick it up when it’s on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1784108763, "timestamp_updated": 1784108763, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "h